---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { pageTitle, breadcrumbJsonLd } from '../lib/seo';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={pageTitle('Terms of Use')}
  description={`Terms of use for ${siteConfig.name}.`}
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
  jsonLd={breadcrumbJsonLd([{ name: 'Terms', path: '/terms/' }])}
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-3xl">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-static mt-6">
      <p>
        By using {siteConfig.name}, you agree to these terms. This is a starter
        document — it is not legal advice. Have a lawyer review it before launch.
      </p>

      <h2>1. The service</h2>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.name} is a directory of public online communities. It is a
        catalog, not a messaging platform and not a financial advisor.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Directory listings are external</h2>
      <p>
        Listings link to third-party communities that we do not control. We do not
        warrant that listings are accurate, current, safe or suitable for any
        purpose. You join external communities at your own risk.
      </p>

      <h2>3. No financial advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this site constitutes financial, investment or trading advice.
        Communities may discuss financial markets; that does not make our listings
        recommendations. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You may browse the directory for personal, non-commercial research. You may
        not use the site to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>scrape the dataset in bulk to republish it as your own directory,</li>
        <li>attack, overload or interfere with the service,</li>
        <li>submit fraudulent, malicious or unauthorized listings,</li>
        <li>harass or impersonate others.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Submissions and reports</h2>
      <p>
        You confirm you have the authority to submit information you provide.
        We may reject, edit or remove submissions at our discretion. Reports are
        reviewed manually and do not automatically change listings.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The site's code and design are original. Platform names and logos belong to
        their respective owners; we are not affiliated with Telegram, WhatsApp,
        Discord or their parent companies.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        The service is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind. To the
        maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for damages arising from
        your use of the site or from third-party communities you visit.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. Continued use after changes constitutes
        acceptance.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
